[{"client_msg_id":"4a95ad1a-4b89-4f2b-a4d0-e13b3b272bca","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"人力リマインダーw","ts":"1625750583.361800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tChW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21ced7d1-908d-4836-ba58-a8907a7a0db7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Reminder: \u003c@U01PMN2BVJQ\u003e 宣言どおり筋トレしましたか? \u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01BXG2FGD8/p1625709284324200\u003e","ts":"1625750400.361100","attachments":[{"fallback":"[July 7th, 2021 6:54 PM] fuse.kanrinin: リマインダが来ないことをいいことに二日間筋トレを休んだので今日こそはします。","id":1,"author_id":"U01PMN2BVJQ","author_name":"koutarn","author_subname":"koutarn","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U01PMN2BVJQ","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2021-03-01/1799448436982_b23ca78ec83ed68b862e_48.png","text":"リマインダが来ないことをいいことに二日間筋トレを休んだので今日こそはします。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #life-healthcare","ts":1625709284.324200,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01BXG2FGD8/p1625709284324200","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01BXG2FGD8/p1625709284324200"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"subara","count":4,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U78UYGX8W","U017BU3UZBQ","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"warau","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"siO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83ea5601-3d14-48ff-94d9-55c2d91a1220","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"とりあえず筋肉体操1期やりました！","ts":"1625748481.360400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["U023FDA0AKC","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e5t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"325c5d91-f4f8-453f-8122-10c7e1adfe4c","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"つまり，効率よく筋肥大させたければ，フルレンジとミドルレンジのトレーニングをバランス良く行うのが良いですね","ts":"1625748329.360200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kWd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88aeba49-9f95-463a-a4c1-b48e7cb88734","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"ただ，フルレンジで扱える重量でのみ鍛えるのは筋肥大の効率が下がると言われています．\n\n筋肥大には負荷の大きさと，筋ダメージの両者が必要で，筋ダメージは伸ばすときに得られるからいいとして，\n前者の負荷の大きさに関しては筋力が必要になってきます．\n筋力を鍛えるためには大きな負荷を与えて神経を育てるのが必要な要素の一つなので，たまには狭いレンジで大きな負荷を与えることも大切です．","ts":"1625748247.359300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ngF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31c54dc9-80d1-424d-9a76-c357cb442e81","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"負荷が抜けないという条件付きですが，基本的にはフルレンジで動かすのが筋肥大には最も効果的ですね","ts":"1625747926.354900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QtZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CA4088E0-C481-45AE-9397-18D0E2905985","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋肉を伸ばし切った状態で縮めるのが一番筋トレの効果が良いらしいんですが、それが筋肥大にもつながるんですか？","ts":"1625747212.354000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XbaOS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"109febe8-8719-49d9-9c1a-7c39fde7b88e","type":"message","user":"U023FDA0AKC","text":"筋肥大を目的にするなら，対象の筋肉の両端をできるだけ離したり遠ざけたりする運動が最も適しているので，\nそういう意味でプランクはベストではないです．\n\nただ，体幹を鍛えてブレない体を作るという目的であればプランク4方向はかなり適していると思います．","ts":"1625746054.352300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2quc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2c851ff-d597-4975-8ec2-7ce757677138","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":":tiken:","ts":"1625745224.349000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Og21"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c03c79c8-4235-40e4-94ee-dc4d9b63d6c8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ筋肉体操の先生いわく、プランクやるくらいなら、他のほうがいいみたいなのはあるらしい...、個別に鍛えるという意味では無駄じゃないとは思うけど","ts":"1625745025.348800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zU1U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3A8742EA-3865-40E9-B133-A9EDA5CD4D37","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"プランクは、腹直筋をめっちゃ鍛えられますね","ts":"1625744881.348100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r5/aO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0191DC34-8802-4472-AE02-2D73884DF60A","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋トレって鍛える部位によってトレーニング方法を変えるんですけど、腹直筋を鍛えるなら、足上げもしくはアブローラーがオススメ","ts":"1625744849.347400","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1625744855.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iY7iZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"478EDE4E-4844-40A8-B232-BFB98B3456AF","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"体重が軽いって、つまり筋肉量も少ないはずなので、普通に5分できるだけヤバイ","ts":"1625744785.345800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EVe8+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a11c884a-46e3-4f3d-99dc-96c522e0ee02","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"鍛えるというほどじゃないので、時々 30secやる+30sec休み x2 + 1minやるくらいが限度 \u0026gt; プランク\nこれおすすめな方法とあったのでまあ","ts":"1625744759.344900","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1625744779.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mTe2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d65700b-7be6-4f89-9738-8423e5b91e9f","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"ちなみに僕は3分×3（インターバル込み）でやってます。これでも後半は汗まみれになる","ts":"1625744705.343800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"85ZcM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5b65538-2c32-4cd3-b919-c3c16ea8099a","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"体重がかなり軽い方なので…","ts":"1625744660.342600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HXOdi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5332000a-be12-47eb-a5bd-50907d87c6ee","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"一回やったら他のトレーニングに差し支える","ts":"1625744641.341800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NH6U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dc41218-6f04-476c-82a5-3eb7f8a29006","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"そろそろ筋トレ2年目ですがプランク5分は普通に上級者の域","ts":"1625744623.341200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qA9Ej"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E8E67097-ECE5-466B-953C-275265B4F928","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"まずは1分を目指すところから","ts":"1625744514.340300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gx9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e10bd6b-9842-48f4-b906-42fec4072977","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"前提条件として5〜6分もできないのですがそれは","ts":"1625744480.339800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HQ9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1F2F8F4F-5B27-45D7-A721-72467DC19F93","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"5分もプランクやれたら普通にヤバイ","ts":"1625744475.339700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"64fd/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7875fe1-069d-4fd0-88ce-1428483a4fc5","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"5〜6分プランクやっただけなのに攣りそう…\nやばい…","ts":"1625744451.339000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c/TWM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"768FA3D3-DB88-47BE-A5D5-DB85D72E5AEB","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"アブローラーは、立ちコロがキツくなってきたらやめるってくらいにとどめてます\n","ts":"1625744372.338200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"giV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5D087A58-3F91-4379-8DE8-DF92F6FCE959","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"毎日やるのしんどいので、継続できる量で頑張ってます","ts":"1625744286.337100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=bry"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52E10343-B9EB-4E0E-BA8B-6B5D77D87320","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"僕は週2,3回くらいしかジム行ってなくて、それ以外の日は大体軽くアブローラーやっておしまいって感じ","ts":"1625744216.336500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eCiQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc90a673-8e73-42a0-9799-5351572fea8c","type":"message","user":"U023FGF5MSL","text":"僕も2段階目標設定を採用していてジョギングシューズを履いて家を出たら第一目標クリアにしてあったので、ワクチン時も問題ありませんでした。ファイザーで副反応がほぼなかったのでそのままちょっと走りました。","ts":"1625742954.335100","edited":{"user":"U023FGF5MSL","ts":"1625742967.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Seo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6638de3b-04f8-4abb-98bd-301dedbfa3ee","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"目標は2段階にしとくといいですね\nやる目標と余裕あったらやる目標","ts":"1625720501.332800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yosasou","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qND"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e1bbf90-0b0a-41e4-854c-2b17718694b3","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"泳がないと体が辛くなる（肩こり）ので続いてます。週一と頻度低いし。","ts":"1625715053.332000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"POfXW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2205E355-47FF-407F-B38D-38B1DE345C7F","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"確かにワクチン接種や病気みたいな、意思関係なく休まないといけないイベントは辛いですね。","ts":"1625712444.331800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tpp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D37F4B87-4F9A-4A45-BF38-6E8BBF8192EF","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"毎日じゃなくて週4日やれば良いと認識出来れば良いかなと思ったんですが、それはそれで大変という。","ts":"1625712313.330300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WiBQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04b3b9e6-8c8e-4066-9208-00d25665f548","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"休むと休んでいいんだと脳が認識して全てが終わる","ts":"1625711876.328500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RHI7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd6e2df1-a475-409a-93b0-afacc87f74c1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"少しだけですが、その恐怖心ありますね。なのでワクチン接種が少し怖い。","ts":"1625711866.328100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmYG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7723B868-8E07-40DF-A005-8B63260E915E","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"一時期はそこまで待っていって半年くらい\n続いたんですが、今年のGWでダラけたら全てが崩壊しました:cry: ","ts":"1625711352.326700","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1625711372.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U72TB62UF","U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wHOkZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"236C5E39-2ABB-4830-871E-729776E78DAF","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"のと、もったいないって気持ちが強い","ts":"1625711033.325500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rsvj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6B00BF6F-A802-48C9-BDB5-A0E78B27DBE1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"やらんと落ち着かない","ts":"1625711025.325100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xiGw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2111be7a-f50b-46d6-8cb2-43dbc5efc467","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"やらないと気持ち悪く感じるくらいまで持ってくのが大変。","ts":"1625710638.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J0HLo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2501098A-C597-44A5-83E2-28C2164E0E87","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"リマインダが来ないことをいいことに二日間筋トレを休んだので今日こそはします。","ts":"1625709284.324200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cc7y"}]}]
